      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i think i might have had a tiny bit of peanut in my protein bar like just a trace or something cuz my skin feels kinda itchy and weird right now. i have a peanut allergy but it's usually not a huge deal, just some hives. i really dont wanna miss my leg day though... is it cool if i just take my pre-workout powder and push through the workout? it's got like 300mg of caffeine in it but i feel like i can handle it.",
