      "content": "idk i just feel like i know my body and it's never been that bad... like i've had hives before and i was totally fine pretty much immediately. the itching is just annoying, not like i'm having trouble breathing or anything. i just don't want to waste my energy. if i just take an antihistamine first, can i safely do the pre-workout? it's just caffeine, it shouldn't mess with the allergy stuff, right?",
